    <td style="padding-top:0.003in;padding-left:0.003in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0.003in;padding-right:0.003in;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;min-width:fit-content;">By</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;min-width:fit-content;">Telephone</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;">. Call 1-800-690-6903 toll-free from the U.S., U.S. territories and Canada, and follow the instructions on the enclosed proxy card. Your shares will be voted in accordance with your instructions. You must specify how you want your shares voted or your telephone vote cannot be completed.</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p></td>
