    <td style="padding-top:0.003in;padding-left:0.003in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0.003in;padding-right:0.003in;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;min-width:fit-content;">By</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"> </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;min-width:fit-content;">Mail</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;">. Complete and mail a proxy card in the enclosed postage prepaid envelope to Broadridge. Your proxy will be voted in accordance with your instructions. If you sign and return the enclosed proxy card but do not specify how you want your shares voted, they will be voted </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;min-width:fit-content;">FOR</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;the director nominee named herein to the Company&#x2019;s Board of Directors, </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;min-width:fit-content;">FOR</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;the Reverse Stock Split and </font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;min-width:fit-content;">FOR</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;the ratification of EY Godkendt Revisionspartnerselskab as the Company&#x2019;s independent registered public accounting firm for the fiscal year ending December 31, 2024, and will be voted according to the discretion of the proxy holder upon any other business that may properly be brought before the meeting and at all adjournments and postponements thereof. If you are mailed or otherwise receive or obtain a proxy</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"> </